# Agent runtime directories (not project assets)
.agents/

# Skills installed by `npx skills add` without -g: the real files live under .agents/
# (ignored above) and only a symlink is dropped here. Committing the symlink would hand
# every cloner a dangling link. skills-lock.json is the record — `npx skills add` restores
# them from it. Listed by name rather than globbed, so a project skill of our own can never
# be swallowed by the pattern; add a line here when installing another pack.
.claude/skills/macos-auto-update
.claude/skills/macos-build
.claude/skills/macos-notch-ui
.claude/skills/macos-patterns
.claude/skills/macos-release
.claude/skills/macos-settings-ui

